          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সমর্থন করা (sômôrthôn kôrā) is Sanskrit samarthana, which Monier-Williams gives both as deliberation and as establishing or vindicating a claim, with করা 'to do'. Bengali uses it for standing behind a view or a person."
